{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/9be4b668d636cd3db47239eac25f3c0c.poster.avif?t=1757273192\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/9be4b668d636cd3db47239eac25f3c0c.webm?t=1757273192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/9be4b668d636cd3db47239eac25f3c0c.mp4?t=1757273192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky has been stolen, and only you as one of three physics breaking bunnies, can bring it back. <br><br>In Coco's Revenge, you\u2019ll hop, phase, and rotate your way through a retro 2D precision platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shift between positive and negative space, and rotate entire stages with the help of your fairy friend to set the fastest stage times possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on tough challenges and stare down bosses, all in the name of saving the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/29322a6690e562c964c40e4aac09744a.poster.avif?t=1757273192\" width=736 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/29322a6690e562c964c40e4aac09744a.webm?t=1757273192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/29322a6690e562c964c40e4aac09744a.mp4?t=1757273192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ stages, including <i>Secret Stages</i> and <i>Challenges</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Biomes and Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack featuring acoustic melodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay mechanics involving spatial awareness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Playable Characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong><i>Coco's Revenge</i><strong> Now!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/440b7eb1b51df9e1345a03df4a403906.poster.avif?t=1757273192\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/440b7eb1b51df9e1345a03df4a403906.webm?t=1757273192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/440b7eb1b51df9e1345a03df4a403906.mp4?t=1757273192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350850?t=1757273192","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/0064bf49aebe90b10377de1c2d2e6d3921fbabe6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757273192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/e3a20c05bcdab3e0f7d259e69036ea8c8d62314e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757273192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/e3a20c05bcdab3e0f7d259e69036ea8c8d62314e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757273192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":